mode: "100644"
text: "# Advocacy program, page content + two worked examples\n\n## Employee-advocacy program blueprint (the growth engine — runs through personal profiles)\n```\n1. Leadership math: 20 employees x 500 connections = 10,000 reach vs 5,000 page followers. Get buy-in.\n2. Pilot: 5-10 natural advocates (already active, real voice) before scaling.\n3. Frictionless kit: give a ready post + 2-3 suggested angles. Employees PERSONALIZE (opener / opinion /\n   question) -- NEVER identical copy (inauthentic + detectable + underperforms).\n4. Notify Employees on high-priority page posts; coordinate engagement in the FIRST 60 MIN.\n5. Light gamification (monthly recognition), not policing. Train on personal branding (-> linkedin-growth).\n6. Track advocacy reach + UTM conversions to prove ROI.\n-> Employees post from their OWN profiles. WoopSocial publishes the PAGE's own posts, not theirs.\n```\n\n## Page content-type table (organic)\n| Format | Why | Note |\n|---|---|---|\n| Carousel / document | highest saves (saves ~5x a like) | step-by-step / framework |\n| Short vertical video (<90s) + captions | +80% reach | completion matters |\n| Custom image | 2x more comments | not text-only |\n| Question / structured framework | 437% more views | sparks multi-threaded discussion |\n| Text-only | ~0.42x reach -- avoid | |\n| External link in body | -60% reach -- put it in the comments | |\n\n## Content-assignment matrix\n```\nPAGE:     announcements, jobs/recruitment, official record, paid assets (Ads/Thought Leader Ads)\nPERSONAL: thought leadership, opinions, stories (-> linkedin-growth) -- where the reach + trust are\nBOTH:     product + case studies (personal for reach, page for the record)\n```\n\n## Worked example 1 - B2B SaaS, real advocacy engine (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nPAGE = credibility + paid launchpad. ENGINE = advocacy: 8-person pilot, frictionless kit they personalize,\nNotify Employees + first-60-min engagement. Page posts = carousels (top saves) + short demo video, link in comments.\nWoopSocial publishes the page's carousels/videos on schedule; employees post from their own profiles (-> linkedin-growth). Thought Leader Ads boost the founder's best post. Track advocacy UTM conversions.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 - small team, founder-led (warm studio voice)\n```\nWith a tiny team, the FOUNDER is the reach engine (people not logos; founder content ~4x). The page holds the\nofficial record + recruitment + the Follow button, and is the launchpad for a light Thought Leader Ad on the\nfounder's post. WoopSocial publishes the page's announcements; the founder's profile growth -> linkedin-growth. Build the advocacy pilot as we hire. Carousels + a question post; links in comments.\n```\n\nBoth: page as credibility hub + paid launchpad (honest about low organic reach); advocacy through personal\nprofiles is the engine; page-appropriate content (carousel/video, no text-only, links in comments); WoopSocial\npublishes the page's own posts while advocacy + paid + native features stay human/native; metrics never fabricated.\n"
